<title>ITALY: Venice '96 airport cargo vol. up on higher truckinG.</title>
<headline>Venice '96 airport cargo vol. up on higher truckinG.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo traffic handled at Venice's Marco Polo airport last year rose to 13,602 tonnes from 13,178 tonnes in 1995, the airport's managing authority SAVA said.</p>
<p>Cargo carried by air slipped to 8,923 tonnnes down from 9,112 tonnes in 1995 whilst that sent by truck 4,679 from 4,065 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>Air traffic was made up of exports of 4,684 tonnes (5,142 in 1995) and imports of 4,239 tonnes (3,970).</p>
